@startuml
title RuleSphere - Author, Validate and Sandbox\nUC-05..09
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #177E8D
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #EAF6F8

actor "Decision Author" as Author
boundary "Management API" as API
participant AuthorizationService as Auth
participant DecisionVersion as Draft
participant DecisionValidator as Validator
participant SandboxService as Sandbox
participant GraphExecutor as Executor

Author -> API: Create/edit Decision graph and schema
activate API

API -> Auth: authorize(author, edit, workspace)
activate Auth
Auth --> API: Access decision
deactivate Auth

break Unauthorized
  API --> Author: Access denied
end

API -> Draft: Store draft graph, schema versions and library pins
activate Draft
note right of Draft
  Editing a frozen version creates a new draft.
  Nodes: Table, Tree, Scripted Expression, Rule Set.
end note
Draft --> API: Draft revision
deactivate Draft

API --> Author: Draft saved
deactivate API

' F-08: Authorization check before reading revision / running validation
Author -> API: Validate draft revision
activate API

API -> Auth: authorize(author, validate, workspace)
activate Auth
Auth --> API: Access decision
deactivate Auth

break Unauthorized validation access
  API --> Author: Access denied
end

API -> Validator: validateDAG(), validateDependencyScope(),\ncheck contracts and schema compatibility
activate Validator

Validator -> Draft: Read graph, schemas, exact references
activate Draft
Draft --> Validator: Revision contents
deactivate Draft

Validator --> API: Issues, validity, breaking-change status
deactivate Validator

API --> Author: Validation result
deactivate API

note over Validator
  Cycles and invalid references block build/publication.
  Breaking changes contribute to risk; not automatically forbidden.
end note

opt UC-09: Author requests sandbox run
  Author -> API: Execute draft with test input
  activate API
  
  API -> Auth: authorize(author, sandbox, workspace)
  activate Auth
  Auth --> API: Access decision
  deactivate Auth
  
  break Unauthorized sandbox access
    API --> Author: Access denied
  end
  
  API -> Sandbox: execute(draft revision, input)
  activate Sandbox
  
  Sandbox -> Validator: Check current revision and input contract
  activate Validator
  Validator --> Sandbox: Validation result
  deactivate Validator
  
  alt Invalid draft or input
    Sandbox --> API: Validation errors
  else Valid executable draft
    Sandbox -> Executor: Execute fixed draft snapshot in sandbox
    activate Executor
    Executor --> Sandbox: Result / attributable error and trace
    deactivate Executor
    Sandbox --> API: Simulation result and protected trace
  end
  deactivate Sandbox
  
  API --> Author: Sandbox result
  deactivate API
end

note over Sandbox,Executor
  Sandbox has no production effect.
  Node execution semantics follow diagram 06.
end note
@enduml
